# `union` matches columns by name, fills missing ones with null and widens types (LANGUAGE.md §3.2).
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/widen/a.csv'
| extend tag = 'a'
| union (from '../../../data/widen/b.csv' | project id, score), '../../../data/reordered/a.csv'
| sort by id asc, score asc nulls first
---- expected
id   | score | tag    | name
long | real  | string | string
-----+-------+--------+-------
   1 | 10.0  | a      | null
   1 | 10.0  | null   | ant
   2 | 20.0  | a      | null
   2 | 20.0  | null   | bee
   3 | 30.0  | null   | cat
   3 | 30.5  | null   | null
   4 | 40.25 | null   | null
